<figure id="A5.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span><span id="A5.T3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">“let” pragmatic split.</span> Solo feature 17451 conflates three
distinct pragmatic roles of <span id="A5.T3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">let</span>: direct suggestion/imperative,
discourse-transition pivot, and permissive allowing. The joint SAE assigns
each role to a distinct feature.</figcaption>
