<figure id="A5.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span><span id="A5.T4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">“cookies” sense split (Gemma 2 9B).</span> Solo feature 52496
conflates the food sense (<span id="A5.T4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">baked cookies</span>) with the web-technology
sense (<span id="A5.T4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">browser cookies, data tracking</span>). The joint SAE separates
them: feat. 7892 inherits the food sense (<math id="A5.T4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\varphi|\!=\!0.741" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.108em">=</mo><mn>0.741</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\varphi|\!=\!0.741</annotation></semantics></math>), while
feats. 29453 and 34623 each specialize on the web/privacy sense
(<math id="A5.T4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\varphi|\!=\!0.875" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.108em">=</mo><mn>0.875</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\varphi|\!=\!0.875</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.T4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.621" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.621</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.621</annotation></semantics></math> respectively).</figcaption>
